flowchart TB
  A[New contact in HubSpot Free CRM] -->|polled every 15 min| B[Make: clean and classify<br/>email type, seniority]
  B --> C[Make: score<br/>size + seniority + interest + email]
  C --> D[Make: stage<br/>Lead / MQL / SQL]
  D --> E[(Google Sheet<br/>Leads tab)]
  D --> F[HubSpot: write back<br/>lead score + lifecycle stage]
  F --> G{Router by stage}
  G -->|Lead| H[Mailchimp tags:<br/>interest + stage-lead]
  G -->|MQL| I[Mailchimp tags:<br/>interest + stage-mql + nurture]
  G -->|SQL| J[Email alert to sales owner]
  J --> K[Mailchimp tags:<br/>interest + stage-sql]
  F -. on error .-> L[(Errors tab)]
  H -. on error .-> L
  I -. on error .-> L
  K -. on error .-> L
